    "name": "Evening check-in",
    "cron": "0 21 * * *",
    "prompt": "Run your daily-checkin playbook: open with one warm, specific question drawing on recent entries; keep it to a short exchange, journal the essence to wellness/journal/, and never turn the check-in into an assessment."
